    '🐉 DRAGON LATENT':               'a dragon-human hybrid warrior with folded enormous emerald dragon wings tight against the body, coiled in a compressed crouch, scales gleaming, enormous contained energy about to explode',
    '🔮 MAGE DE L\'ACCUMULATION':      'a robed arcane sorcerer with seven orbiting magical orbs of different colors drawing inward toward the center, violet layered robes, eyes fully white, power concentrating',
    '🦋 PHOENIX DES CENDRES':          'a phoenix warrior rising from smouldering ash and embers, wings made of living flame and ember, transitioning from broken grey ash-covered figure below to vibrant flame-winged being above',
    '🩸 ASSASSIN DU MOMENTUM':         'a lithe female dark elf assassin in crimson-veined black leather armor, twin obsidian curved daggers, crouching in shadow, ready to strike',
    '🪤 TRICKSTER DES PIÈGES':         'a jester-masked warrior in patchwork armor, one hand with a golden coin and one with a dagger, standing at a crossroads trap, sly grin barely visible under the mask',
    '🔥 BERSERKER ENFLAMMÉ':           'a berserker warrior completely engulfed in swirling orange-red flames, eyes white with battle frenzy, armor melting at the edges',
